# PROTECTION OF WOMEN AND CHILDREN VICTIMS OF VIOLENCE

REGIONAL GAZETTE

# REGIONAL REGULATION OF GUNUNGKIDUL REGENCY

(Official News of the Gunungkidul Regency Government)

Number: 16 Year: 2012 Series: E

NUMBER 25 YEAR 2012

CONCERNING

PROTECTION OF WOMEN AND CHILDREN VICTIMS OF VIOLENCE

BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD

THE REGENT OF GUNUNGKIDUL,

Considering:







a. that all forms of acts of violence against women and children constitute violations of human rights so that their dignity and honor need to be protected and their right to life guaranteed in accordance with their nature and disposition without discrimination;
b. that in addition to protection efforts, prevention, services, and empowerment are needed for women and children victims of violence;
c. that there is a need for regulation of efforts as referred to in letter b in the region;
d. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a, letter b, and letter c, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning Protection of Women and Children Victims of Violence;

In View of:







1. Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;
2. Law Number 15 Year 1950 concerning the Establishment of Regency Regions within the Special Region of Yogyakarta (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1950 Number 44);
3. Law Number 32 Year 2004 concerning Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2004 Number 125, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4437) as has been amended several times most recently by Law Number 12 Year 2008 (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2008 Number 59, Supplement to the State Gazette Number 4844);
4. Government Regulation Number 32 Year 1950 concerning Determination of the Effective Date of Law Year 1950 Number 12, 13, 14 and 15 concerning the Establishment of Regency regions within Central Java Province, West Java and the Special Region of Yogyakarta (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1950 Number 59);
5. Government Regulation Number 4 Year 2006 concerning Implementation and Cooperation for Recovery of Victims of Domestic Violence, State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2006 Number 15, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4604;
6. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection of the Republic of Indonesia Number 1 Year 2010 concerning Minimum Service Standards for Integrated Services for Women and Children Victims of Violence;
7. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection of the Republic of Indonesia Number 05 Year 2010 concerning Guidelines for the Establishment and Development of Integrated Service Centers;
8. Regional Regulation of the Special Region of Yogyakarta Number 3 Year 2012 concerning Protection of Women and Children Victims of Violence (Regional Gazette of the Special Region of Yogyakarta Province Year 2012 Number 3);
9. Regional Regulation of Gunungkidul Regency Number 2 Year 2008 concerning Regional Government Affairs (Regional Gazette of Gunungkidul Regency Year 2008 Number 01 Series E) as has been amended by Regional Regulation of Gunungkidul Regency Number 8 Year 2010 concerning Amendment to Regional Regulation of Gunungkidul Regency Number 2 Year 2008 concerning Regional Government Affairs (Regional Gazette of Gunungkidul Regency Year 2010 Number 07 Series E);

With Joint Approval

REGIONAL HOUSE OF REPRESENTATIVES

GUNUNGKIDUL REGENCY

THE REGENT OF GUNUNGKIDUL,

DECIDES:

To Establish:

REGIONAL REGULATION CONCERNING PROTECTION OF WOMEN AND CHILDREN VICTIMS OF VIOLENCE.

